            <div xml:id="m-822bcc36-e7bd-439a-a04e-6f65750524f6">
              <lg xml:id="m-b0902f9e-b272-4289-ab82-e30cb49d1d5d">
                <l xml:id="m-dae0f051-0fa4-4397-ad94-eba2391c8171" facs="#m-d793cddc-429a-4a67-8ab6-37d8dd26ba5c" label="text-like">Sunday at None.</l><l xml:id="m-95c21a55-3492-4d01-b5eb-05c1124853ce" facs="#m-582c8c53-326d-41fd-9bff-6cc7a8779974" label="ambiguous">247</l><l xml:id="m-dd663552-1b92-4d19-b092-2a481aa47474" facs="#m-a024d942-038a-40a8-aa5e-211604364d1e" label="lyrics-like">Princípium verbórum tuórum, vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-75b1e99a-794d-4e97-9a81-0c1854ba6b33" facs="#m-779c058f-53f2-44be-95c4-aa533c1e6a66" label="lyrics-like">nia túa: *quia ómnes víae méae</l><l xml:id="m-1fdd4522-95d0-4907-a143-0cec8ab10e9a" facs="#m-c6381a87-3589-483a-8419-8f694d5b0ac4" label="lyrics-like">ritas: * in aetérnum ómnia judicia</l><l xml:id="m-dc161fc9-2e32-4bc1-a0bd-2865f92ea106" facs="#m-7f7cbed9-fc06-412d-9fd6-2dcdc9e1ef1c" label="lyrics-like">in conspéctu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-3710229f-f570-4498-a4c5-671079b1d4c5" facs="#m-d03e0f39-ea8f-4c4e-86e7-e6f3a088e01f" label="lyrics-like">justitiae túae.</l><l xml:id="m-e2e5542a-3157-466a-bb27-b8ea8fab689c" facs="#m-65581dfd-bfd0-4ab6-8e11-ab673b75d58b" label="lyrics-like">Appropinquet deprecátio méa in</l><l xml:id="m-fb03da41-3913-4166-a383-f493c431e7c2" facs="#m-d48cf108-0d04-48c3-b008-0aa563b8ca62" label="lyrics-like">conspéctu tũo Dómine:* juxta eló¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf17144c-377a-4bda-aa7a-db9cb2687499" facs="#m-2b17b060-cd6a-4d61-b529-87f96fb08ec0" label="ambiguous">Psalm 118. XI.</l><l xml:id="m-190117b0-0ead-4f9a-acd9-86a900e3c664" facs="#m-f4497502-7324-4402-8fdf-c9ca0d417141" label="lyrics-like">quium túum da mihi intelléctum.</l><l xml:id="m-38c00820-dfc8-453e-bdda-01d362a96d6d" facs="#m-534b5b52-9fcd-4c65-a14d-128ad5973fa9" label="lyrics-like">DRíncipes persecúti súnt me</l><l xml:id="m-8026e51f-dce1-4977-958b-a9d62ae4945a" facs="#m-fde01832-b5b8-4353-be61-0ad1a6e6c1e9" label="lyrics-like">Intret postulátio méa in conspé¬</l><l xml:id="m-3318dd71-6e7a-403f-845f-e943e2134562" facs="#m-5653e75f-0ba0-4a37-a802-cbb5488115af" label="lyrics-like">E grátis: “ et a vérbis túis for¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0f59122-4a4a-4e74-bdb0-fdfa6511e0ef" facs="#m-9035031c-b687-40ff-aa5a-438a2361167d" label="lyrics-like">ctu túo:* secúndum elóquium túum</l><l xml:id="m-4bba6303-4dc4-41fa-bcc2-3e7ad670c709" facs="#m-5c60c312-8f02-40a7-9303-dd37011dc243" label="lyrics-like">midávit cor méum.</l><l xml:id="m-2d4b92ad-4b36-43df-9404-b08b49a42c3d" facs="#m-450b3cae-2a74-4bc9-aa0d-7caed6faa9cb" label="lyrics-like">éripe me.</l><l xml:id="m-392b4fe1-5158-4a34-a379-6de0d82bcbc3" facs="#m-9cc239a4-c31a-44a1-9d1b-fbb568d8c8d2" label="lyrics-like">Laetábor égo super elóquia túa:</l><l xml:id="m-c5bcba69-ca56-46b5-812d-13cd8332f19e" facs="#m-b09ea73b-8bd8-45d4-a1dc-c4f924953efd" label="lyrics-like">Éructábunt lábia méa hymnum.</l><l xml:id="m-7471992a-f4a4-426a-9f51-a8e223bd57ea" facs="#m-7676211f-92aa-46e1-ace0-5d524c6088a4" label="lyrics-like">sicut qui invénit spólia múlta.</l><l xml:id="m-c4ea7049-7440-4499-bca1-3b43501526d8" facs="#m-cf0aa2f1-e938-4c1e-be79-1fc8c2582e98" label="lyrics-like">cum docúeris me iustificatiónes túas.</l><l xml:id="m-466bbed8-b9f3-4734-92c9-90c3649b7d88" facs="#m-13958983-3ff1-4382-8d40-bf979337ba33" label="lyrics-like">Iniquitátem ódio hábui, et abo¬</l><l xml:id="m-47661da0-dad6-4c5c-b871-e04b0641ef01" facs="#m-e0f0f20e-6da8-495b-8889-51e4968b99e3" label="lyrics-like">Pronuntiábit lingua méa elo¬</l><l xml:id="m-0339cad5-b3e6-4ba3-beb6-7125e76a23b4" facs="#m-032d5d27-25e4-4884-ad4d-d94528ff5972" label="lyrics-like">minátus sum :* légem autem túam</l><l xml:id="m-f1fcf554-1de5-476d-9701-83a385a45570" facs="#m-9a40cdaa-25d1-4bc8-b854-160633f2ec70" label="lyrics-like">quium tuum:* quia ómnia mandáta</l><l xml:id="m-7bae942d-eaac-4e51-b8a3-e0e4871d889d" facs="#m-0ab6973b-9349-4f74-9742-7a93488b1a91" label="lyrics-like">diléxi.</l><l xml:id="m-a631214e-da01-4650-80fb-60ca010c00f1" facs="#m-e2702b08-19ed-42bc-8a95-a19e14fae640" label="lyrics-like">túa aequitas.</l><l xml:id="m-6c990d25-0b07-4fcd-971e-adb9208dea41" facs="#m-033cb882-1d6d-4927-8e31-94533a3d1d72" label="lyrics-like">Sépties in die láudem dixi tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-6feb197e-5efe-4a6b-80b3-af497a70123f" facs="#m-4bfe7433-da5f-4069-8ad4-d0f0b0cef6c5" label="lyrics-like">Fiat mánus túa ut sálvet me:</l><l xml:id="m-1d394dbd-2221-4fa0-9894-de675b0a0b10" facs="#m-9519ecd3-e010-4578-8e25-f4d0a1e53b7f" label="lyrics-like">super judicia justitiae túae.</l><l xml:id="m-81e385b7-afef-4f85-865c-c1a96be2efb3" facs="#m-d4800bcd-ce67-4db6-becf-276539490205" label="lyrics-like">quóniam mandáta túa elégi.</l><l xml:id="m-c06defbc-6642-4ba0-9d90-fddbc79b154b" facs="#m-9ec81cb6-453d-45ed-8b45-662db5744bbc" label="lyrics-like">Pax múlta diligéntibus légem</l><l xml:id="m-f03e2097-7937-4b29-9555-8716b737f259" facs="#m-cbb29609-0b3c-4475-86d3-5c4094aa38b2" label="lyrics-like">Concupsvi salutáre túum Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-afaace26-fd88-4c9d-9d68-68ec7df91849" facs="#m-8f7a1eb4-2ceb-48e3-b7bf-fcdbb23d73ea" label="lyrics-like">túam:* et non est Illis seandalum.</l><l xml:id="m-dd32c59a-affb-484b-abd3-99245ea12c2a" facs="#m-43e6d891-01c4-4dcb-aa3e-1ee29d3df738" label="lyrics-like">ne:"et lex túa meditátio méa est.</l><l xml:id="m-576dd96c-3e09-4092-b45d-3a2d976e54aa" facs="#m-245c5319-0913-4241-8fb2-b2cf7dc86185" label="lyrics-like">Exspectábam salutáre túum Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8554f5fc-c185-48b4-a62d-4355422af3bd" facs="#m-cd9679f0-921e-4891-bc68-e71755a4fdbd" label="lyrics-like">Vivet ánima méa, et laudábit</l><l xml:id="m-ee75e43b-0eb3-49b6-8bb3-575f5c066a7c" facs="#m-491c2a24-beda-44b4-9458-44a0d4f09d61" label="lyrics-like">mine:*et mandáta túa diléxi.</l><l xml:id="m-b931e767-3734-4c47-a00e-1ac320597ad2" facs="#m-96da0342-89d0-4ba7-96c4-010245cb2533" label="lyrics-like">te:*et judicia túa adiuvábunt me.</l><l xml:id="m-664bf58b-65bc-4931-8259-d70b2f9162ca" facs="#m-b7cf2540-c4fd-4286-bcea-f7fb96a42b24" label="lyrics-like">Custodivit ánima méa testimónia</l><l xml:id="m-a80d23c3-847e-47a9-9e5e-fa10949b631b" facs="#m-52b98f35-994a-45a1-9f3b-013af40a82fe" label="lyrics-like">Errávi sicut óvis quae périit:</l><l xml:id="m-5cb6f9d8-0986-49ad-b87c-d2d327ff997e" facs="#m-d776b09d-4909-4227-a965-f27b21b7a644" label="lyrics-like">túa:* et diléxit éa veheménter.</l><l xml:id="m-0ece31d5-edaa-49f0-9ca9-43c30ceebfab" facs="#m-f076e858-87be-4ab8-9830-9ca52c72ad0e" label="lyrics-like">quaére sérvum túum, quia mandáta</l><l xml:id="m-01c3fe70-5b54-49c7-a1b2-040a521c3647" facs="#m-fd56324c-9108-4adf-977c-55649230a83b" label="lyrics-like">Servávi mandáta túa et testimó¬a non sum oblitus.</l><l xml:id="m-d3c548c9-cba7-4c5b-b5dd-c39554cbad9d" facs="#m-b6be27b8-3a23-44ae-9589-b714ff53b7be" label="text-like">During the Year.</l><l xml:id="m-ed6bf6df-d839-43ab-9568-74ee583b90f2" facs="#m-b44ee121-8404-45e8-adb6-ce502b05b782" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-17b3f837-3a73-4269-a8f2-040898deaf91" facs="#m-35fc9f9d-aa2b-4f1b-a347-344c6fec59a1" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia, fáci-em tú-am, Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-486db8ba-801c-4949-bca2-9b9fff20b4c5" facs="#m-ec443bef-77f4-4036-9e4e-6ca7fa6ced9a" label="lyrics-like">illúmina super</l><l xml:id="m-21b6f3b0-0734-4355-9a4c-7079d5600d27" facs="#m-3a53233d-02ad-4bde-b5e7-5261f3c9d52e" label="lyrics-like">sérvum tú-um, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-53dd5f6e-e458-4d51-89db-bea36b42225e" facs="#m-5105e72e-b09d-4efa-921d-ead1edf0f50e" label="ambiguous">r. Cor. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-961fa0e8-2e87-4945-b1c5-e919dc130e99" facs="#m-81dab0ee-130f-499e-936b-6d2223a19cc2" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-fa1d0da2-a893-4e00-ac5d-a02caf5c01f6" facs="#m-3d2d00c5-970b-4c61-99fd-dfbe7dfd984f" label="lyrics-like">(Mpti enim estis prétio magno. *] córpore vestro.</l><l xml:id="m-f5e43924-da3a-4c24-bb6e-bd49247f4d58" facs="#m-64df3b8f-9286-4045-ab06-a7fe66cdbd11" label="lyrics-like">R. Déo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-171b3696-82ab-498c-bfad-b42462e38147" facs="#m-47425f89-589d-4cec-8ca2-13721623cdc0" label="lyrics-like">U Glorificáte et portáte Deum in</l><l xml:id="m-d3c976a6-e1fd-4a0a-932c-2e4ce7955f4a" facs="#m-2f657eb6-088d-4cae-9356-165a702cf922" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-1790db9d-db77-440c-a5f8-68c4198f0aff" facs="#m-f4a4feb7-1bff-495d-918d-13365b2c38db" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-4273b3a1-a584-4ebd-a6c9-719246fb4432" facs="#m-156b3eb0-8d5f-4da0-94a1-0f701f3a309c" label="lyrics-like">Lamávi in tóto córde mé-:"“Exáudi me Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6243f670-2868-4419-8cb0-5083f521ed98" facs="#m-760d1a36-5f91-492d-bdae-f9f8b156e7f0" label="lyrics-like">ne. V. Justi-fica-ti-ónes tú-as requí-ram. Gló-ri-a Pátri,</l><l xml:id="m-73be573f-0b9c-4530-a006-d7bb26821c34" facs="#m-424a3fb0-a755-4598-9625-47826a76bb9c" label="lyrics-like">et Fí-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-367bc920-5c2d-404b-924b-ae2a996f603b" facs="#m-5936efd1-8f98-4333-8fc2-00de8e13a8cf" label="lyrics-like">V. Ab occúltis méis múnda me Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-37775cbd-227f-4b15-923a-b095b535b1ae" facs="#m-dfa4c579-3918-4626-acc9-fddd007ff5f3" label="lyrics-like">R. Et ab aliénis párce sérvo túo.</l></lg>
